{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "e48f40f399e6a0d2786a5de63688afa4",
    "m_Title": "Como leer este grafo",
    "m_Content": "Pulsa A para ver todo el grafo (F centra la seleccion).\nLos datos viajan de IZQUIERDA a DERECHA hasta el Master Stack (a la derecha del todo).\nCada recuadro numerado es un PASO; la nota amarilla de su izquierda lo explica.\nLos circulos/cuadros dentro de los nodos son vistas previas del valor en ese punto.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -330.0,
        "y": -540.0,
        "width": 700.0,
        "height": 330.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": ""
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "9774c9cc6d29a49818c51268ad38bc2e",
    "m_Title": "V1 \u00b7 Olas (posicion XZ)",
    "m_Content": "VERTEX: usamos la posicion de MUNDO (x,z) para que las olas sean continuas entre planos vecinos. Cada ola: sin(dot(direccion, XZ) * frecuencia + tiempo). Sumamos 3 olas con distinta direccion/frecuencia/velocidad.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -430.0,
        "y": 0.0,
        "width": 380.0,
        "height": 374.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "f32d463b8136164b5a857d8f2e391006"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "13e28e09fbb83459b3101be67c8e878a",
    "m_Title": "V2 \u00b7 Subir los vertices",
    "m_Content": "Desplazamos a lo largo de la normal (mundo) y volvemos a Object.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -430.0,
        "y": 1180.0,
        "width": 380.0,
        "height": 234.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "ed7ad69b544f3e24d5236a1df9047573"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "95da3d2ce8d18d7b36f528348c45407b",
    "m_Title": "V3 \u00b7 Inclinar la normal",
    "m_Content": "La pendiente de la ola inclina la normal: asi la luz y el reflejo 'ven' las olas.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -430.0,
        "y": 1760.0,
        "width": 380.0,
        "height": 234.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "4199bd54538541e1970a39235081a30b"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "a101f868eea865fe27ca4f42d62d442d",
    "m_Title": "1 \u00b7 Profundidad del agua",
    "m_Content": "Scene Depth - profundidad del pixel del agua = cuanta agua hay delante del fondo.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -430.0,
        "y": 2340.0,
        "width": 380.0,
        "height": 234.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "1aa3f959556ddafd3ad9f1ec250c1153"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "86159d6582656b2d1b941d6227cb540b",
    "m_Title": "2 \u00b7 Reflejo del cielo",
    "m_Content": "Fresnel: de lado el agua refleja el cielo; de frente se ve a traves.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -430.0,
        "y": 3220.0,
        "width": 380.0,
        "height": 234.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "f6b4961319e6624e7b831290a95a8913"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "df4b39e12f14ba45f7fd604a64ba7ac9",
    "m_Title": "3 \u00b7 Espuma",
    "m_Content": "Dos fuentes: orilla (poca profundidad) y crestas de ola, rotas con ruido.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -430.0,
        "y": 3980.0,
        "width": 380.0,
        "height": 234.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "e476e642477b2bd9f1e9a92f93349e14"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "2d863fe66fdf3c7c8e242681d88ac893",
    "m_Title": "4 \u00b7 Salida",
    "m_Content": "Smoothness alto = reflejo de luz (brillo). Alpha = agua + espuma + fresnel.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -430.0,
        "y": 4710.0,
        "width": 380.0,
        "height": 234.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "62e0dc015fa21739972921c849535ec1"
    }
}

